tead of selling. Until I answer, sell as now. From ENT-014: the made harvesters wait for Zero's places (requests.log ENT-128); until then they stay in storage as the fleet's reserve (Zero's ENT-115). Book what your scripts buy for a chain as money spent once (`gate.book_onetime`, block UNITY), and carapace sells as plate (game/fleet/plate.py) until the station is in sight (your suggestion, accepted).
